 gold. Melting it would have yielded a messy alloy that was difficult to sell. This has led to the \"lesser-known\" theory that the X was sold intact to a private collector in Switzerland or the Middle East. Id X.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:07:35Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Jules rimet", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:07:47Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Jules", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:07:50Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "great crack", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:07:54Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "The original Jules Rimet trophy is correct", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:08:00Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Sal ki speed bhi 8th wonder hai", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:08:13Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Pavan 33 Sayu 10 Sal 33 Khandoba 3", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:08:15Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "the answer and Q came at the same time to me", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:08:22Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Sal ties with last question to go", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:08:39Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "i am now reading about copycats of DB Cooper", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-05T05:08:49Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "this rabbit hole goes deep"